{
  "bodyHash": "jAnRu0XIB/E=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\">本模组将在我的大学入学考试结束后进行全面更新重构！！！加油！！！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这是「更好的加载界面」模组，完美复刻了Forge 1.12.2风格的加载界面，并支持高度自定义！同时兼容Fabric和Forge。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">视频演示更直观：</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9ueDc0N_a_o\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自定义功能：</strong>（配置文件路径：/config/better_loading_screen/config.json5）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 背景图片/颜色</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 进度条颜色</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 禁用内存显示</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 更改字体</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 更多功能即将到来！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>兼容整合：</strong>（可通过配置关闭）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 继承KubeJS配色方案</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 继承All The Tweaks配色方案及背景图</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Forge 1.16用户注意：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">由于Forge 1.16自带简陋的预加载界面（在模组加载前就会显示），您可以选择：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>忍受它</strong> <em>或者</em> 在JVM参数后添加 <span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">-Dfml.earlyprogresswindow=false</span> 来禁用</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
